00:18:24,420 --> 00:18:25,760
God knows best.

270
00:18:25,760 --> 00:18:27,480
He has the best intention for me.

271
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:28,940
My heart is flawed.

272
00:18:28,940 --> 00:18:32,240
I shouldn't follow my heart, because it's going to lead me astray.

273
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:34,620
